{
  "@context": {
    "rdf": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#",
    "rdfs": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#",
    "owl": "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#",
    "label": {
      "@id": "rdfs:label",
      "@container": "@language"
    },
    "comment": {
      "@id": "rdfs:comment",
      "@container": "@language"
    },
    "subClassOf": {
      "@id": "rdfs:subClassOf",
      "@type": "@id"
    },
    "isDefinedBy": {
      "@id": "rdfs:isDefinedBy",
      "@type": "@id"
    },
    "seeAlso": {
      "@id": "rdfs:seeAlso",
      "@type": "@id"
    },
    "versionInfo": "owl:versionInfo"
  },
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "@type": "owl:Ontology",
      "label": {
        "ja": "タスク管理",
        "en": "Task management"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "作業を管理するためのデータ。何を、誰が、いつまでにするか、どのマイルストーンに向けてか。課題管理システムのチケット、カレンダーの ToDo、自治体の作業指示に共通する部分を扱い、状態と優先度は RFC 8984（JSCalendar）に合わせます。システム固有の呼び方はエイリアスで使えます。",
        "en": "Data for tracking work: what needs to be done, by whom, by when and for which milestone. It covers what issue trackers, calendar to-dos and municipal work orders have in common; status and priority follow RFC 8984 (JSCalendar). System-specific names can be used with aliases."
      },
      "versionInfo": "1.0.0",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/context/task/v1.0.0.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/Milestone",
      "@type": "rdfs:Class",
      "label": {
        "ja": "マイルストーン",
        "en": "Milestone"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "プロジェクトの中でタスクをまとめる予定の目標。Redmine のバージョン、GitHub や GitLab のマイルストーン、Jira の修正バージョンなど。名前、期限、状態を持つ。",
        "en": "A planned target that groups tasks within a project: a version in Redmine, a milestone in GitHub or GitLab, a fix version in Jira. It has a name, a due date and a state."
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Milestone/"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/Project",
      "@type": "rdfs:Class",
      "label": {
        "ja": "プロジェクト",
        "en": "Project"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "タスクをまとめる単位。案件、災害対応の 1 オペレーション、キャンペーンなど、名前は用途によって変わっても共通の属性を持つ。",
        "en": "A grouping of tasks: a project in a tracker, one disaster-response operation, a campaign. Called differently in different settings, with the same common attributes."
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Project/"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/Task",
      "@type": "rdfs:Class",
      "label": {
        "ja": "タスク",
        "en": "Task"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "追跡される作業単位。課題管理システムの「チケット」「Issue」、カレンダーの ToDo、自治体の作業指示など。状態と優先度の値域は RFC 8984（JSCalendar）に合わせ、元システム固有の状態名や種別は statusLabel と subtype に保持する。位置は任意のジオメトリ。",
        "en": "A tracked unit of work: a ticket or issue in a tracker, a calendar to-do, a municipal work order. State and priority follow RFC 8984 (JSCalendar); the source system's own status name and kind are kept in statusLabel and subtype. Location may be any geometry."
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/assignee",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "assignee"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "担当者・担当チーム（人・組織・チームのエンティティ。このサブジェクト外の URN でもよい）。key-values 形式では対象が 1 つでも配列",
        "en": "Assignees: person, organisation or team entities, possibly outside this subject. Always an array in the key-values form, even with one target"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#assignee"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/completedAt",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "completedAt"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "progress が completed になった日時",
        "en": "When progress became completed"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#completedAt"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/due",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "due"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "期限（予定したリリース・完了）。日付、または日時",
        "en": "Due: the planned release or completion, a date or a date and time"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Milestone/#due"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/end",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "end"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "予定期間の終了。日付、または日時",
        "en": "Planned end: a date, or a date and time"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Project/#end"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/estimatedDuration",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "estimatedDuration"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "見積時間。ISO 8601 期間（例: PT1H30M）（RFC 8984 estimatedDuration）",
        "en": "Estimated effort as an ISO 8601 duration, e.g. PT1H30M (RFC 8984 estimatedDuration)"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#estimatedDuration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/externalId",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "externalId"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "元システムにおける識別子",
        "en": "Identifier in the system of record"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Milestone/#externalId"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/isPrivate",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "isPrivate"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "非公開なら true。既定は false",
        "en": "true when private; default false"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#isPrivate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/isPublic",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "isPublic"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "公開プロジェクトなら true",
        "en": "true when public"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Project/#isPublic"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/milestone",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "milestone"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "予定しているマイルストーン（バージョン、リリース）",
        "en": "The milestone (version, release) this is planned for"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#milestone"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/milestoneStatus",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "milestoneStatus"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "状態。open=受付中、locked=ロック中（新しいタスクを追加できない）、closed=完了。core context の status は予約語のため milestoneStatus",
        "en": "State: open = accepting tasks, locked = no new tasks may be added, closed = done; status is protected in the core context, hence milestoneStatus"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Milestone/#milestoneStatus"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/parent",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "parent"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "親プロジェクト",
        "en": "Parent project"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Project/#parent"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/percentComplete",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "percentComplete"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "進捗率 0〜100（RFC 8984 percentComplete）",
        "en": "Completion 0 to 100 (RFC 8984 percentComplete)"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#percentComplete"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/priority",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "priority"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "優先度 0〜9。1 が最高、9 が最低、0 は未定義（RFC 8984）",
        "en": "Priority 0 to 9: 1 highest, 9 lowest, 0 undefined (RFC 8984)"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#priority"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/progress",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "progress"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "正規化した進行状態（RFC 8984 progress）。needs-action=未着手、in-process=対応中、completed=完了、failed=失敗、cancelled=取消。値域に合う値がないときは省き、statusLabel に元の呼び方を書く。",
        "en": "Normalised state (RFC 8984 progress): needs-action = not started, in-process = in progress, completed = done, failed = failed, cancelled = cancelled. When no value fits, leave it out and give the local wording in statusLabel."
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#progress"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/project",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "project"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "所属プロジェクト",
        "en": "The project this belongs to"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Milestone/#project"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/projectStatus",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "projectStatus"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "状態。active=進行中、closed=終了、archived=アーカイブ済み（使わなくなったが残している）。core context の status は予約語のため projectStatus",
        "en": "State: active = in progress, closed = finished, archived = no longer used but kept; status is protected in the core context, hence projectStatus"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Project/#projectStatus"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/refersTo",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "refersTo"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "このタスクが対象とするエンティティ（通報、設備、道路など）",
        "en": "The entity this task is about (a report, an asset, a road)"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#refersTo"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/relatedTo",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "relatedTo"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "関連するタスク（key-values 形式では対象が 1 つでも配列）。関係の種類（blocks, precedes, duplicates など）は拡張で表す",
        "en": "Related tasks. Always an array in the key-values form, even with one target. The kind of relation (blocks, precedes, duplicates) is left to extensions"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#relatedTo"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/spatialId",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "spatialId"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "タスクの範囲を覆う空間ID（ZFXY）。任意",
        "en": "Spatial IDs (ZFXY) covering the task. Optional"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#spatialId"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/start",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "start"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "予定期間の開始。日付、または日時",
        "en": "Planned start: a date, or a date and time"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Milestone/#start"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/statusLabel",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "statusLabel"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "元システムの状態名そのまま（「対応中」「解決」など）。progress を省いたときは必須",
        "en": "The source system's own status name, unchanged (for example \"In progress\", \"Resolved\"). Required when progress is left out"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#statusLabel"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/subtype",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "label": {
        "en": "subtype"
      },
      "comment": {
        "ja": "元システムの種別（トラッカー、Issue タイプ、カテゴリなど）",
        "en": "The source system's kind, for example a tracker, an issue type or a category"
      },
      "isDefinedBy": "https://datamodels.jp/ns/task/",
      "seeAlso": "https://datamodels.jp/models/task/Task/#subtype"
    }
  ]
}
